1
00:02:24,319 --> 00:02:26,319
Welcome to the wine competition.

2
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:29,039
Next up is Valley Breeze Group's winemaker

3
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,520
Ye Xiaowei, presenting

4
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,159
Eucalyptus Leaf.

5
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,039
Judges, please have a taste.

6
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,639
Although Ms. Ye is new to winemaking,

7
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:40,960
she is very likely

8
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:42,840
a dark horse in this competition.

9
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,080
It seems the judges

10
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,400
are very satisfied with Eucalyptus Leaf.

11
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,280
Let's welcome

12
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,280
the winemaker,

13
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,199
Ye Xiaowei!

14
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,240
Are you ready?

15
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:02,759
Go ahead.

16
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:03,960
Go and embrace

17
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,120
the glory that belongs to you.

18
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,840
Here I go.

19
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,080
I'll wait for you right here.

20
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,159
I once thought

21
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:21,719
the dark night of my life

22
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:23,280
had finally seen the dawn.

23
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,479
Success.

24
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,560
Love.

25
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:26,280
Family.

26
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:29,000
I had everything I ever longed for.

27
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,759
Ms. Ye,

28
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,560
as for your inspiration for Eucalyptus Leaf,

29
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,599
would you mind sharing it?

30
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:34,039
It was someone

31
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:36,840
who is very special to me.

32
00:03:37,759 --> 00:03:39,479
We truly must thank this mysterious person

33
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:42,080
for inspiring you to craft this fine wine.

34
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:46,560
What's going on?

35
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:50,680
There's something wrong with this wine!

36
00:03:51,919 --> 00:03:52,639
There must be!

37
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,400
Ye Xiaowei!

38
00:03:59,039 --> 00:03:59,759
It's her!

39
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:00,960
It's Ye Xiaowei!

40
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,199
Ms. Ye,

41
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:03,280
we suspect a problem with your wine.

42
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,360
Please cooperate with our investigation.

43
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,319
It wasn't me!

44
00:04:05,599 --> 00:04:06,560
It wasn't me!

45
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,680
Little did I know,

46
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,519
this light was just an illusion,

47
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,519
fading in an instant.

48
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,519
Cheng An!

49
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,199
Cheng An...

50
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:29,480
Give me a child.

51
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,639
Wanmei.

52
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:33,680
I want a child who can inherit the Cheng family.

53
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,639
Go and embrace

54
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:49,800
the glory that belongs to you.

55
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,160
I'll wait for you right here.

56
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:14,399
Good morning, Grandma.

57
00:05:46,279 --> 00:05:47,800
You really have no manners.

58
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:51,800
As expected from a bastard

59
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,240
with no upbringing.

60
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:59,120
Aunt, with your candid personality,

61
00:05:59,399 --> 00:06:01,519
you must have learned a lot of manners.

62
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:04,000
I wonder which teacher taught you.

63
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:06,560
Maybe you could introduce them to me,

64
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:10,120
a bastard with no upbringing.

65
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,319
What did you say?

66
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:14,160
I'm complimenting you, Aunt.

67
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:16,040
You don't sweat the small stuff,

68
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,879
and you speak without a filter.

69
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,639
Of course, I need to learn from you.

70
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,199
Mom!

71
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,480
Look at her!

72
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:27,000
She dares to badmouth me right to your face.

73
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:29,279
Who knows how she badmouths us in private.

74
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:30,959
Or how she badmouths you!

75
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:31,759
Eat your food.

76
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:34,120
You need to rein in that temper of yours.

77
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,279
Mom,

78
00:06:36,519 --> 00:06:37,680
I'm done eating.

79
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:38,839
I still have work at the company.

80
00:06:39,519 --> 00:06:40,600
I'll be going now.

81
00:06:40,759 --> 00:06:41,360
Go ahead.

82
00:06:41,959 --> 00:06:43,720
Remember what I told you. These days,

83
00:06:43,879 --> 00:06:45,000
don't cause any trouble.

84
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,480
Keep your head down.

85
00:06:47,079 --> 00:06:48,759
I've heard it a million times.

86
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:51,680
Don't worry, I'll be good.

87
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:00,920
Auntie Ying.

88
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,600
Yes?

89
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,639
Since you have free time today,

90
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:05,360
teach Miss Sang Luo the house rules.

91
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,480
I don't want something like this

92
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,279
to happen ever again.

93
00:07:08,519 --> 00:07:09,680
Yes, ma'am.

94
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,160
The Cheng family wakes up at 4:00 AM every day.

95
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,879
At 4:30 sharp, we pay respects to the old madam.

96
00:07:17,519 --> 00:07:18,600
Morning exercise is at 5:00.

97
00:07:18,839 --> 00:07:20,920
It must last at least two hours.

98
00:07:21,199 --> 00:07:23,480
Keeping a good physical and mental state

99
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,040
represents the Cheng family's image.

100
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,800
Breakfast is at 7:00 sharp.

101
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:27,879
We wait for no one.

102
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,079
Are you done?

103
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:36,120
Call a car for me. I'm going out.

104
00:07:36,519 --> 00:07:37,399
How unfortunate.

105
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,839
Miss Ruolin just took the last car.

106
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:43,240
What about the housekeeper's car?

107
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,959
That's the staff's utility vehicle.

108
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,279
I need to go out for groceries later

109
00:07:47,279 --> 00:07:48,839
to prepare lunch for the old madam.

110
00:07:49,199 --> 00:07:50,959
There's a bus stop nearby.

111
00:07:51,519 --> 00:07:52,920
It's not far from here.

112
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:55,639
It's only a three-kilometer walk at most.

113
00:07:58,639 --> 00:08:00,199
It seems that in the Cheng family,

114
00:08:01,079 --> 00:08:02,920
Auntie Ying acts with complete impunity.

115
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:07,800
I don't understand what you mean, Miss.

116
00:08:10,319 --> 00:08:13,079
Then Auntie Ying isn't a very smart servant.

117
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,839
As a dog,

118
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,839
when your master is lonely,

119
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:22,160
you can get whatever you want.

120
00:08:22,879 --> 00:08:24,920
But once your master finds a new pet,

121
00:08:25,519 --> 00:08:26,639
the old dog

122
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,560
will be sold off cheap and slaughtered.

123
00:08:48,519 --> 00:08:50,879
Mind if I hitch a ride, Uncle?

124
00:08:52,799 --> 00:08:53,600
Yes, I do.

125
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,519
If I say I mind,

126
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,200
Uncle, you can reject

127
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,799
someone on the same path as you.

128
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:10,519
But to reject

129
00:09:10,519 --> 00:09:12,720
someone trying hard to keep pace with you

130
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,399
is just too cold.

131
00:09:18,279 --> 00:09:19,279
I know

132
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,320
I'm very ordinary,

133
00:09:21,879 --> 00:09:23,159
and plain.

134
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:26,399
I don't have a dazzling appearance,

135
00:09:28,639 --> 00:09:30,879
but I really like you.

136
00:09:31,159 --> 00:09:32,360
For the rest of my life,

137
00:09:33,279 --> 00:09:34,799
I want to be on the same path as you.

138
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,159
And I'll work hard to keep pace with you.

139
00:09:40,759 --> 00:09:41,759
You're not plain.

140
00:09:42,279 --> 00:09:43,279
And you're not ordinary.

141
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:46,159
In my heart,

142
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,720
you are the most dazzling of all.

143
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:55,159
Learned that from a playbook.

144
00:10:14,759 --> 00:10:15,879
To the bus stop.

145
00:10:24,759 --> 00:10:26,080
I didn't expect

146
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:28,720
you to like such a modest car, Uncle.

147
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,559
I prefer cars like this.

148
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:33,919
Not too flashy on the outside,

149
00:10:34,159 --> 00:10:35,759
but with exceptional performance.

150
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:38,320
Often, beneath a glamorous exterior,

151
00:10:38,559 --> 00:10:41,000
lie disappointing flaws.

152
00:10:42,919 --> 00:10:43,799
Ms. Sang,

153
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,039
sounds like you've done your research.

154
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,000
Just a little.

155
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:50,039
Just like how some positions

156
00:10:50,039 --> 00:10:51,039
are filled by

157
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:53,000
people who aren't necessarily the best fit.

158
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,240
What do you mean?

159
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:57,200
Uncle, your proposal the other day was rejected, wasn't it?

160
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:58,679
Second Uncle's team

161
00:10:58,679 --> 00:11:01,200
can't even make a decent financial report,

162
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:04,000
yet they easily overturned your proposal.

163
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,559
Grandma even said it was to save your pride.

164
00:11:06,759 --> 00:11:08,399
Talk about playing favorites.

165
00:11:10,759 --> 00:11:12,360
This is Valley Breeze's internal business.

166
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:14,399
It has nothing to do with you.

167
00:11:14,399 --> 00:11:16,960
I thought I was here to solve this very problem.

168
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:19,320
Don't you want Valley Breeze

169
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,399
to be better?

170
00:11:20,519 --> 00:11:22,840
We'll talk when you actually join the company.

171
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:25,120
That'll be soon, Uncle.

172
00:11:43,279 --> 00:11:45,399
Thank you all for attending today's press conference.

173
00:11:45,399 --> 00:11:47,000
At this year's wine competition,

174
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,759
Valley Breeze Group's winemaker Ye Xiaowei

175
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:51,720
added banned substances to her wine,

176
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:54,600
causing a judge acute kidney failure.

177
00:11:54,879 --> 00:11:57,919
Valley Breeze takes full responsibility,

178
00:11:57,919 --> 00:12:01,960
and will donate 5 million to the Kidney

179
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:05,240
Care Foundation for patient recovery.

180
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:07,960
Next, please welcome Cheng Feng, Chairman of Valley Breeze,

181
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:10,000
to make a formal statement regarding this incident.

182
00:12:10,639 --> 00:12:11,679
First of all,

183
00:12:11,679 --> 00:12:12,840
on behalf of the group,

184
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:16,240
I apologize to the judges who were hurt.

185
00:12:16,879 --> 00:12:18,600
Since Valley Breeze was founded over 50 years ago,

186
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:20,759
we have never compromised on consumer health.

187
00:12:21,279 --> 00:12:21,840
This time,

188
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:24,320
it was our failure in personnel management.

189
00:12:24,879 --> 00:12:27,039
However, Ye Xiaowei's competition wine

190
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:28,720
was developed independently by her,

191
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:31,320
and has no connection to any Valley Breeze products.

192
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:35,440
We've ended all cooperation with Ms. Ye,

193
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:38,080
and are fully cooperating with the probe.

194
00:12:38,559 --> 00:12:39,360
In fact,

195
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:41,679
the gatekeeper for every production step

196
00:12:41,679 --> 00:12:43,159
is my wife,

197
00:12:43,159 --> 00:12:46,720
and our chief winemaker, Lin Wanmei.

198
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:49,240
She has been immersed in this industry for over a decade.

199
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,720
Her standards for quality

200
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,399
are even stricter than those she sets for me.

201
00:12:52,399 --> 00:12:54,759
That's why Evening Breeze, her creation,

202
00:12:54,759 --> 00:12:57,039
won the championship at this competition

203
00:12:57,039 --> 00:13:01,000
and topped sales in its first season.

204
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,440
It doesn't rely on luck,

205
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,519
but on standards.

206
00:13:03,519 --> 00:13:04,799
Donating five million yuan

207
00:13:04,799 --> 00:13:06,159
isn't just crisis PR.

208
00:13:06,159 --> 00:13:08,320
It's Valley Breeze's responsibility to the industry.

209
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,600
We believe

210
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,759
a responsible brand

211
00:13:11,759 --> 00:13:13,320
won't let the mistakes of others

212
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:15,600
shake its own foundation.

213
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:29,120
We spent so much money to hire you.

214
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:31,440
And you show me this garbage?

215
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,600
You can't even balance

216
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,759
the basic fruit and wine aromas.

217
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,240
And you want to enter the wine competition?

218
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,799
You'd be eliminated in the first round!

219
00:13:41,519 --> 00:13:42,279
Right now,

220
00:13:42,279 --> 00:13:44,320
red wines that can rival Evening Breeze

221
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,159
are truly rare.

222
00:13:46,399 --> 00:13:48,159
Evening Breeze is my life's work.

223
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:49,799
In the current domestic wine market,

224
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,039
there is simply not a single wine

225
00:13:51,039 --> 00:13:52,279
that can compare to it.

226
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,159
Yes, yes, yes.

227
00:13:53,919 --> 00:13:54,720
It's just that...

228
00:13:54,879 --> 00:13:56,080
relying solely on Evening Breeze

229
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,120
is hardly enough to sustain

230
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:59,000
Valley Breeze's market demand and status.

231
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,759
Do I need you to tell me that?

232
00:14:00,799 --> 00:14:01,600
I heard

233
00:14:02,200 --> 00:14:04,000
there's a mysterious winemaker in France,

234
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:04,720
Kista.

235
00:14:05,159 --> 00:14:07,039
Recently, her wine appeared at the Fengtang Club.

236
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:09,639
I wonder if she intends to enter the domestic market.

237
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:10,960
If

238
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:11,840
we can manage

239
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,759
to get her as a consultant for our group,

240
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:16,039
perhaps in this wine competition,

241
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:17,840
we can take first place again.

242
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,440
It's just that...

243
00:14:20,879 --> 00:14:21,759
Just what?

244
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:23,000
No one has ever seen Kista.

245
00:14:23,799 --> 00:14:25,600
The Fengtang Club...

246
00:14:28,799 --> 00:14:30,360
Money makes the world go round.

247
00:14:30,799 --> 00:14:33,080
Do everything you can to get her info.

248
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,799
You must contact her in person.

249
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:36,240
Yes, Ms. Lin.

250
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:39,159
Throw this garbage out.

251
00:14:39,559 --> 00:14:40,519
Yes.

252
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,000
Open the door.

253
00:14:47,679 --> 00:14:49,000
Afraid of a misunderstanding?

254
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:51,039
Your older brother is gone.

255
00:14:51,039 --> 00:14:52,120
What are you afraid of?

256
00:14:57,039 --> 00:14:58,080
This matter

257
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,000
really shouldn't be discussed with the door open.

258
00:15:05,559 --> 00:15:07,279
Do you want that position?

259
00:15:07,799 --> 00:15:08,679
What position?

260
00:15:08,679 --> 00:15:10,679
You know exactly what I mean.

261
00:15:11,879 --> 00:15:14,200
Old Madam Cheng wants Cheng Yan in power.

262
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:16,039
But look at him.

263
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:18,480
If Valley Breeze is handed over to him,

264
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:21,039
Cheng Feng's life's work will be ruined.

265
00:15:22,799 --> 00:15:24,120
You wouldn't want to see that, right?

266
00:15:24,879 --> 00:15:26,320
I will support you.

267
00:15:26,799 --> 00:15:29,039
As long as Valley Breeze is in our hands,

268
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:31,480
Cheng Feng's efforts won't be in vain.

269
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,080
It's better than

270
00:15:33,879 --> 00:15:36,279
having someone else ruin it, right?

271
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:40,200
Don't you think?

272
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:58,799
Sister-in-law.

273
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:02,279
You want me to be your regent.

274
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,279
Cheng An.

275
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,679
Give me some time.

276
00:16:17,039 --> 00:16:18,399
If there's nothing else,

277
00:16:18,879 --> 00:16:20,120
you can leave now.

278
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,039
Don't make a fool of yourself here.

279
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:38,039
Some things are up to fate,

280
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,879
but it also takes human effort.

281
00:16:40,399 --> 00:16:41,200
Cheng An.

282
00:16:41,679 --> 00:16:43,039
Valley Breeze isn't yours,

283
00:16:43,159 --> 00:16:44,320
nor is it mine.

284
00:16:45,039 --> 00:16:46,600
But it can be ours.

285
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:18,119
A lowly bastard

286
00:17:18,279 --> 00:17:20,119
has no right to covet my Cheng An.

287
00:17:20,799 --> 00:17:21,640
So...

288
00:17:23,319 --> 00:17:25,319
was this all your doing?

289
00:17:25,319 --> 00:17:28,079
Delusions come with a price.

290
00:17:32,279 --> 00:17:34,680
Let me teach you one last lesson today.

291
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,119
Rats

292
00:17:36,599 --> 00:17:38,440
belong in the gutter.

293
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,880
The fame and fortune in the spotlight,

294
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,319
the people and the things...

295
00:17:42,359 --> 00:17:44,279
you don't deserve any of them.

296
00:17:53,519 --> 00:17:55,079
Cheng An...

297
00:17:58,400 --> 00:17:59,839
Cheng An said

298
00:18:00,119 --> 00:18:02,240
he got tired of playing with you long ago.

299
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:03,880
He also said

300
00:18:04,319 --> 00:18:06,759
the sight of you makes him sick.

301
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:11,319
Go to hell!

302
00:18:34,519 --> 00:18:35,319
Hurting again?

303
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,680
This is nothing.

304
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:40,519
They haven't tasted real pain yet.

305
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:41,960
Take a break if it hurts.

306
00:18:42,119 --> 00:18:43,039
Don't push yourself.

307
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:45,319
Some wounds

308
00:18:46,319 --> 00:18:47,799
must be paid back by yourself

309
00:18:47,799 --> 00:18:49,079
to find redemption.

310
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,279
Alright.

311
00:18:50,519 --> 00:18:51,519
What's next then?

312
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:52,880
What do you want to do?

313
00:18:53,119 --> 00:18:54,440
I just joined the Cheng family.

314
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:56,640
I haven't gained their trust yet.

315
00:18:58,519 --> 00:19:00,839
So I just need a chance to break the ice.

316
00:19:04,279 --> 00:19:05,079
Boss.

317
00:19:05,079 --> 00:19:05,880
Miss Sang.

318
00:19:06,119 --> 00:19:07,279
Old Madam Cheng is downstairs.

319
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:11,759
Please enjoy.

320
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:14,680
Fengtang Club's food is always reliable.

321
00:19:15,039 --> 00:19:17,759
They even use the finest Beluga caviar.

322
00:19:18,119 --> 00:19:20,240
I went to Juehuang with a friend the other day.

323
00:19:20,279 --> 00:19:22,519
They used sturgeon instead of Beluga.

324
00:19:22,880 --> 00:19:24,240
How could anyone eat that?

325
00:19:26,640 --> 00:19:27,640
Grandma.

326
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:29,839
What brings you here?

327
00:19:30,319 --> 00:19:31,240
If I had known you were here,

328
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,799
I would've come with you.

329
00:19:33,319 --> 00:19:34,160
Isn't this place

330
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:35,799
a private club?

331
00:19:35,839 --> 00:19:37,680
Miss Sang is an old friend of our boss.

332
00:19:37,799 --> 00:19:40,240
She's a lifetime member of Fengtang Club.

333
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:44,039
Let me introduce you.

334
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,400
This is my

335
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:48,440
newly found biological granddaughter.

336
00:19:48,640 --> 00:19:49,440
Her name is Luoluo.

337
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:51,240
Luoluo,

338
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:53,240
come say hello to these two ladies.

339
00:19:53,319 --> 00:19:54,119
Okay.

340
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:57,480
Nice to meet you.

341
00:19:57,599 --> 00:19:58,799
Hello, ladies.

342
00:19:59,039 --> 00:20:00,200
I'm Cheng Feng's daughter,

343
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,240
my name is Sang Luo.

344
00:20:01,839 --> 00:20:04,359
For the 20-odd years I couldn't serve

345
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:05,640
the Cheng family, I feel deep regret.

346
00:20:05,839 --> 00:20:07,799
Grandma's birthday happens to be next month,

347
00:20:08,319 --> 00:20:09,880
I want to plan a grand celebration.

348
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:11,599
Manager Dong.

349
00:20:12,559 --> 00:20:13,920
On the 18th of next month,

350
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:16,440
clear the schedule at Fengtang Club.

351
00:20:16,599 --> 00:20:18,160
And that newly arrived batch

352
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:19,200
of Kista wine,

353
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:20,440
reserve all of it too.

354
00:20:20,799 --> 00:20:22,400
I'll use it for Grandma's birthday.

355
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,000
Okay.

356
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:24,200
I'll arrange it right away.

357
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:28,039
I also hope you two ladies

358
00:20:28,039 --> 00:20:29,359
will bring your friends and join us.

359
00:20:29,359 --> 00:20:30,640
You mean that incredibly rare

360
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:31,960
wine by Master Kista?

361
00:20:32,039 --> 00:20:33,440
I heard her wines

362
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:35,599
are always reserved by the elites.

363
00:20:35,759 --> 00:20:38,559
Even I've only had the privilege of tasting it once.

364
00:20:38,599 --> 00:20:40,960
You must all come then.

365
00:20:41,119 --> 00:20:42,400
As for the wine,

366
00:20:42,759 --> 00:20:44,240
we'll have plenty for everyone.

367
00:20:47,319 --> 00:20:50,000
The whole family is waiting just for you.

368
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,839
Have you no shame?

369
00:20:51,839 --> 00:20:52,799
Mom.

370
00:20:52,799 --> 00:20:54,200
I didn't do it on purpose.

371
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:55,720
I was just going to check out

372
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,160
the birthday venue for you.

373
00:20:58,559 --> 00:20:59,119
Oh, right.

374
00:20:59,359 --> 00:21:01,880
Don't worry about my birthday venue.

375
00:21:02,279 --> 00:21:04,319
My birthday venue is set at Fengtang.

376
00:21:05,039 --> 00:21:08,000
Wanmei, go prepare the invitations after dinner.

377
00:21:08,359 --> 00:21:10,079
I want to use Master Kista's wine

378
00:21:10,279 --> 00:21:11,799
to entertain the guests.

379
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:15,279
And I'll showcase Valley Breeze's new wine

380
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:16,440
for everyone to taste.

381
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,000
Mom,

382
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:20,319
Fengtang is fully booked.

383
00:21:20,559 --> 00:21:21,279
Besides,

384
00:21:21,279 --> 00:21:24,200
Master Kista's wine can't be bought.

385
00:21:24,480 --> 00:21:26,079
Did I say I was counting on you?

386
00:21:27,400 --> 00:21:28,160
These things,

387
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:29,839
Luoluo has already taken care of them.

388
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:32,720
You just need to prepare the new products,

389
00:21:33,079 --> 00:21:35,000
and make sure Valley Breeze doesn't lose face.

390
00:21:38,599 --> 00:21:39,200
Mom,

391
00:21:39,599 --> 00:21:41,240
with just this little brat?

392
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:42,200
How is that possible?

393
00:21:42,319 --> 00:21:43,319
Why wouldn't it be possible?

394
00:21:44,039 --> 00:21:46,279
Luoluo is an honored guest of Boss Yi.

395
00:21:46,799 --> 00:21:47,799
This little matter

396
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:49,200
is hardly a challenge for her.

397
00:21:50,319 --> 00:21:53,200
Luoluo, do you know

398
00:21:53,519 --> 00:21:55,319
Yi Kai from Fengtang Club?

399
00:21:55,559 --> 00:21:58,240
I worked in South Korea for a while.

400
00:21:58,839 --> 00:22:00,480
I happened to run into Boss Yi

401
00:22:00,599 --> 00:22:02,200
getting into a conflict with some locals.

402
00:22:03,039 --> 00:22:04,480
Seeing he was a fellow countryman,

403
00:22:04,839 --> 00:22:05,960
I gave him a hand.

404
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:09,200
My dear niece has pretty good luck.

405
00:22:09,799 --> 00:22:12,039
Being able to latch onto someone like Boss Yi.

406
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:13,480
So, Luoluo,

407
00:22:13,519 --> 00:22:15,640
you didn't get caught in the crossfire, did you?

408
00:22:16,160 --> 00:22:17,039
No.

409
00:22:17,519 --> 00:22:18,680
Don't worry, Grandma.

410
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,240
Since I was little,

411
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:23,000
my mom and I only had each other to rely on.

412
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:25,599
We met our fair share of malicious people.

413
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:28,400
If I didn't have a few tricks up my sleeve,

414
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:30,400
I wouldn't be alive today.

415
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:32,720
What a poor child.

416
00:22:33,079 --> 00:22:33,799
Rest assured,

417
00:22:34,119 --> 00:22:36,240
from now on, the Cheng family will back you up.

418
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:37,759
I'd like to see who

419
00:22:38,039 --> 00:22:39,720
would still dare to bully you.

420
00:22:46,319 --> 00:22:47,319
Come on,

421
00:22:47,519 --> 00:22:48,359
let's eat.

422
00:22:53,359 --> 00:22:54,359
Grandma,

423
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:55,720
have some of this.

424
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:56,720
Okay.

425
00:23:27,319 --> 00:23:28,920
Using red roses to pay your respects...

426
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:29,920
In this entire cemetery,

427
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:31,319
you're the only one who'd do this.

428
00:23:31,680 --> 00:23:33,160
These are Xiaowei's favorite flowers.

429
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:35,279
If I brought anything else,

430
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:36,880
she'd be upset.

431
00:23:37,119 --> 00:23:37,920
Cheng An.

432
00:23:38,119 --> 00:23:39,960
Don't underestimate a woman's jealousy.

433
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:42,839
Even if there's more to the competition,

434
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,480
the fact that she hurt Lin Wanmei

435
00:23:44,480 --> 00:23:45,480
is undeniable.

436
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:48,240
Even if everyone else suspects her,

437
00:23:50,119 --> 00:23:50,920
I don't.

438
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:54,079
I know she's not that kind of person.

439
00:23:55,319 --> 00:23:57,119
I mentored Xiaowei myself.

440
00:23:58,279 --> 00:24:00,279
I taught her how to make wine,

441
00:24:00,880 --> 00:24:02,240
but I failed to teach her how to conduct herself.

442
00:24:02,240 --> 00:24:03,359
She needed to keep a level head.

443
00:24:04,000 --> 00:24:04,880
She was too eager for success,

444
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:06,759
and couldn't take defeat, so she hurt me.

445
00:24:07,079 --> 00:24:08,480
For the sake of your happiness,

446
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:10,839
I'm willing to sign a letter of forgiveness.

447
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:12,640
I disagree!

448
00:24:14,400 --> 00:24:15,200
Brother...

449
00:24:15,359 --> 00:24:16,160
Cheng An,

450
00:24:16,839 --> 00:24:18,160
your sister-in-law was lucky this time

451
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,200
to escape with her life.

452
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:19,839
Yes,

453
00:24:19,839 --> 00:24:21,920
Ye Xiaowei has some talent,

454
00:24:22,079 --> 00:24:23,720
but look at what she's done.

455
00:24:23,799 --> 00:24:24,920
Just to win the championship,

456
00:24:25,039 --> 00:24:27,640
she laced the wine with deadly arsenic!

457
00:24:28,119 --> 00:24:29,119
As for those judges,

458
00:24:29,119 --> 00:24:30,640
if they hadn't been treated in time,

459
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:31,559
our Valley Breeze Group

460
00:24:31,559 --> 00:24:33,000
we'd face a manslaughter lawsuit by now.

461
00:24:37,599 --> 00:24:38,240
Hello?

462
00:24:38,440 --> 00:24:38,960
Cheng An,

463
00:24:38,960 --> 00:24:40,039
I just landed in Seoul.

464
00:24:40,319 --> 00:24:41,920
The prison informed me that Ms. Ye

465
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:43,039
committed suicide to escape punishment.

466
00:24:59,920 --> 00:25:01,680
Cheng An, take my advice.

467
00:25:01,680 --> 00:25:03,920
Let go of Ye Xiaowei, and spare yourself.

468
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:06,519
The succession battle is at a key stage.

469
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:08,519
Don't get distracted by someone who isn't worth it.

470
00:25:09,079 --> 00:25:09,880
He Li.

471
00:25:11,039 --> 00:25:12,440
I want to be alone for a while.

472
00:25:15,680 --> 00:25:18,279
Disguise is what Cheng An does best.

473
00:25:18,839 --> 00:25:20,279
Around the Cheng family and Valley Breeze,

474
00:25:20,279 --> 00:25:21,880
he has never taken off his mask.

475
00:25:22,279 --> 00:25:23,039
Tell me,

476
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:25,440
when you wear a mask for too long,

477
00:25:25,960 --> 00:25:27,799
do you end up fooling even yourself?

478
00:25:29,799 --> 00:25:30,880
Do you really not feel bad for him?

479
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:33,240
I heard that all these years, Cheng An

480
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:35,160
has been investigating the past incident.

481
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:36,680
Of course he'd investigate it.

482
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:38,799
Such a massive scandal,

483
00:25:39,279 --> 00:25:40,799
how could he not take full advantage of it

484
00:25:40,799 --> 00:25:42,440
and pin it on his rivals?

485
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,039
It seems that now,

486
00:25:46,039 --> 00:25:47,480
the Cheng family is going to put on quite a show.

487
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:48,279
Of course.

488
00:25:49,759 --> 00:25:51,400
All the pain I've suffered

489
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:52,880
will be repaid double.

490
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:16,440
She's asking for it.

491
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:17,440
Seeing her like this...

492
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:19,799
...I'm itching to hit her.

493
00:26:24,279 --> 00:26:25,039
Scream!

494
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:30,960
She's asking for it.

495
00:26:32,759 --> 00:26:34,319
Why isn't she fighting back?

496
00:26:35,160 --> 00:26:36,720
Yeah, why isn't she fighting back?

497
00:26:37,839 --> 00:26:39,039
Someone told me...

498
00:26:39,039 --> 00:26:40,640
...to take good care of you in here.

499
00:27:00,279 --> 00:27:01,799
What they want,

500
00:27:02,079 --> 00:27:03,279
what they cherish,

501
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:05,680
I'll take it all away.

502
00:27:10,720 --> 00:27:11,680
Oh, my dear girl.

503
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:12,880
You're finally here.

504
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:13,519
Where's the bag?

505
00:27:14,079 --> 00:27:15,000
We need to return it quickly

506
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:16,440
before Madam finds out.

507
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:19,279
What happened to it?

508
00:27:19,880 --> 00:27:20,559
I kept telling you

509
00:27:20,559 --> 00:27:21,160
to be careful.

510
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:21,839
Be careful!

511
00:27:21,880 --> 00:27:22,720
How could you...

512
00:27:23,640 --> 00:27:24,599
What do we do now?

513
00:27:24,960 --> 00:27:26,440
Will she make us pay for it?

514
00:27:28,759 --> 00:27:29,519
Oh, you.

515
00:27:29,519 --> 00:27:31,000
Stop idling around all day,

516
00:27:31,039 --> 00:27:32,559
and hanging out with shady friends.

517
00:27:32,559 --> 00:27:34,240
Find a good man and get married soon.

518
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:35,680
You're always making me worry.

519
00:27:36,079 --> 00:27:37,680
Well, I want to marry Cheng An!

520
00:27:37,680 --> 00:27:38,680
But you won't let me.

521
00:27:38,960 --> 00:27:40,039
Don't even think about it.

522
00:27:40,039 --> 00:27:41,720
Stay far away from the Cheng men.

523
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:43,240
Can't I even dream about it?

524
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:46,799
Auntie Ying.

525
00:27:49,200 --> 00:27:50,599
This is your daughter, right?

526
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:53,000
She's so pretty.

527
00:27:54,559 --> 00:27:55,839
Madam's bag got dirty.

528
00:27:55,839 --> 00:27:58,279
I had Xiaoyu take it out to clean it.

529
00:27:58,799 --> 00:27:59,599
Today

530
00:27:59,680 --> 00:28:01,079
happens to be her birthday,

531
00:28:01,200 --> 00:28:02,279
so the two of us

532
00:28:02,279 --> 00:28:03,519
just chatted for a bit.

533
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,480
Since it's her birthday,

534
00:28:06,880 --> 00:28:08,759
why doesn't she stay the night?

535
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:09,799
There's no need...

536
00:28:09,799 --> 00:28:10,680
Yes, I'd love to!

537
00:28:10,759 --> 00:28:12,039
I'll stay

538
00:28:12,039 --> 00:28:12,799
and keep Mom company.

539
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:16,200
Auntie Ying,

540
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:17,680
we're all family.

541
00:28:17,799 --> 00:28:19,799
It's only right she stays to keep you company.

542
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:21,079
Don't be so polite.

543
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:31,720
LV crocodile skin.

544
00:28:32,480 --> 00:28:33,680
You can't buy this domestically.

545
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:34,720
Madam, I...

546
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:36,079
Do you like this bag?

547
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:39,480
Having been with Aunt for so many years,

548
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:41,680
Auntie Ying certainly has good taste.

549
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:43,680
You misunderstood, Madam.

550
00:28:43,759 --> 00:28:45,640
There was a coffee stain on this bag.

551
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:47,519
I took it out to be cleaned.

552
00:28:47,559 --> 00:28:48,279
This bag...

553
00:28:48,279 --> 00:28:50,240
when Cheng An went to Italy,

554
00:28:50,880 --> 00:28:52,880
Feng specifically asked him to buy it for me.

555
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:55,519
It really is a special gift.

556
00:28:56,160 --> 00:28:57,039
You can have it.

557
00:28:57,279 --> 00:28:58,279
I can't accept this.

558
00:28:58,559 --> 00:29:00,039
Sir gave this to you.

559
00:29:00,279 --> 00:29:01,799
It wouldn't be appropriate for me to take it.

560
00:29:02,440 --> 00:29:03,440
Feng is gone.

561
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:05,880
This family has to look forward.

562
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:07,880
I can't dwell on his belongings forever.

563
00:29:08,079 --> 00:29:09,039
Besides,

564
00:29:09,240 --> 00:29:10,559
if Feng knew

565
00:29:10,559 --> 00:29:12,039
how well Auntie Ying takes care of me,

566
00:29:12,359 --> 00:29:14,039
he'd want to thank you too.

567
00:29:15,079 --> 00:29:15,880
In that case,

568
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:17,440
I'll accept it.

569
00:29:19,960 --> 00:29:21,079
I'll go back to work downstairs then.

570
00:29:21,079 --> 00:29:22,039
If you need anything, Madam,

571
00:29:22,039 --> 00:29:22,920
just call me.

572
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:23,680
Mm.

573
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:38,680
It's been dry lately,

574
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:40,640
Mom made Snow fungus and lily bulb soup

575
00:29:40,640 --> 00:29:41,880
to soothe everyone's throats.

576
00:29:54,279 --> 00:29:55,319
Sorry about that.

577
00:29:56,359 --> 00:29:57,039
It's fine.

578
00:29:57,039 --> 00:29:58,039
I can do it myself.

579
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:05,480
Pei Yu.

580
00:30:06,079 --> 00:30:06,920
Where's mine?

581
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:09,000
You can serve yourself.

582
00:30:12,640 --> 00:30:13,440
Auntie Ying.

583
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:14,880
What is this?

584
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:16,279
Playing favorites?

585
00:30:18,039 --> 00:30:18,920
Come here.

586
00:30:21,559 --> 00:30:22,359
Auntie Ying.

587
00:30:22,640 --> 00:30:23,519
Is the Cheng house

588
00:30:23,559 --> 00:30:25,400
a place just anyone can enter?

589
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:27,279
I asked Xiaoyu to stay.

590
00:30:27,640 --> 00:30:29,119
Today is Xiaoyu's birthday.

591
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:29,960
I thought

592
00:30:29,960 --> 00:30:31,119
she could have a meal with Auntie Ying.

593
00:30:31,359 --> 00:30:33,200
How long have you been with the Chengs?

594
00:30:33,359 --> 00:30:34,680
And you're already calling the shots?

595
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:37,039
Who knows what you'll do next.

596
00:30:39,319 --> 00:30:40,119
Grandma.

597
00:30:40,119 --> 00:30:40,839
Aunt.

598
00:30:41,039 --> 00:30:41,920
I'm sorry.

599
00:30:42,279 --> 00:30:43,640
I didn't think it through.

600
00:30:45,039 --> 00:30:45,880
Sit down.

601
00:30:47,480 --> 00:30:48,279
Pei Yu,

602
00:30:49,079 --> 00:30:49,880
you

603
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:51,640
should stay with us a few more days

604
00:30:51,680 --> 00:30:53,119
to keep Auntie Ying company.

605
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:55,799
Thank you, Old Madam Cheng.

606
00:30:57,200 --> 00:30:58,279
Thank you, Old Madam Cheng.

607
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:03,480
Let's eat.

608
00:31:11,359 --> 00:31:12,160
Here.

609
00:31:12,599 --> 00:31:13,920
Mom saved this just for you.

610
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:16,279
Bird's nest.

611
00:31:20,960 --> 00:31:22,240
You need to behave yourself

612
00:31:22,279 --> 00:31:24,160
and steer clear of the Chengs.

613
00:31:24,240 --> 00:31:25,240
Especially Cheng An.

614
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:26,720
Why?

615
00:31:26,799 --> 00:31:28,759
He's the one Old Madam dislikes the most.

616
00:31:28,759 --> 00:31:29,799
Any day now,

617
00:31:29,799 --> 00:31:31,039
he could get kicked out of the company.

618
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:32,759
Aren't they all Old Madam's sons?

619
00:31:32,759 --> 00:31:33,920
What do you know?

620
00:31:37,160 --> 00:31:38,400
What about Cheng Yan?

621
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:39,440
Absolutely not!

622
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:41,400
He's Old Madam Cheng's absolute favorite.

623
00:31:41,839 --> 00:31:43,480
Other mothers always hope their daughters

624
00:31:43,480 --> 00:31:44,640
marry into wealthy families.

625
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:46,920
I want you to marry well too,

626
00:31:47,039 --> 00:31:48,640
but not the Chengs.

627
00:31:54,119 --> 00:31:54,759
Mom,

628
00:31:54,759 --> 00:31:56,440
you're spoiling Auntie Ying too much.

629
00:31:56,440 --> 00:31:58,440
How could you let her daughter stay here?

630
00:31:59,039 --> 00:32:01,319
It's rare for them to reunite.

631
00:32:01,440 --> 00:32:02,440
Even so, it's not right.

632
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:03,680
It's completely against the rules.

633
00:32:03,880 --> 00:32:05,799
Rules are secondary.

634
00:32:06,880 --> 00:32:08,880
My third son isn't getting any younger.

635
00:32:08,960 --> 00:32:10,200
It's time he settled down.

636
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:11,880
I can tell Auntie Ying's daughter

637
00:32:12,599 --> 00:32:14,599
quite likes him.

638
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:45,480
You know what?

639
00:32:46,160 --> 00:32:48,519
A rose may seem arrogant.

640
00:32:48,519 --> 00:32:49,519
Its thorns

641
00:32:49,759 --> 00:32:52,200
hurt those who try to hurt it,

642
00:32:52,279 --> 00:32:54,480
but also scare away those who love it.

643
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:01,000
But you know what?

644
00:33:01,319 --> 00:33:03,799
If you look closely, you'll find

645
00:33:03,799 --> 00:33:04,960
it's actually

646
00:33:05,200 --> 00:33:07,119
a very gentle little flower.

647
00:33:07,559 --> 00:33:08,559
So,

648
00:33:09,039 --> 00:33:10,440
you like this little flower?

649
00:33:12,279 --> 00:33:13,400
Alright then, now I know.

650
00:33:13,880 --> 00:33:14,880
Know what?

651
00:33:15,599 --> 00:33:17,279
I just know, don't worry about it.

652
00:33:18,079 --> 00:33:19,079
Smell it, does it smell nice?

653
00:33:36,400 --> 00:33:37,200
Madam.

654
00:33:37,359 --> 00:33:38,640
You don't make a sound when you walk.

655
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:39,720
You scared me.

656
00:33:40,359 --> 00:33:42,480
Is this how Auntie Ying educates her daughter?

657
00:33:42,759 --> 00:33:44,599
Walking around half-dressed in this house.

658
00:33:44,839 --> 00:33:46,359
What do you mean half-dressed?

659
00:33:47,799 --> 00:33:48,759
If you ask me,

660
00:33:48,759 --> 00:33:50,839
you're jealous of my youth and beauty.

661
00:33:55,799 --> 00:33:56,880
You married a dead man,

662
00:33:56,880 --> 00:33:58,440
and actually think you're a phoenix now.

663
00:33:58,960 --> 00:33:59,880
Wait till I win over Cheng An.

664
00:33:59,880 --> 00:34:01,000
We'll see how arrogant you can be then.

665
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:02,079
What kind of behavior is this?

666
00:34:02,480 --> 00:34:03,759
Making such a racket late at night.

667
00:34:03,759 --> 00:34:04,799
How improper.

668
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:07,359
It's so late.

669
00:34:07,759 --> 00:34:08,880
Heading out to have fun?

670
00:34:08,960 --> 00:34:10,199
No, Madam.

671
00:34:10,960 --> 00:34:11,960
I can't sleep.

672
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:13,000
I'm just going for a walk.

673
00:34:13,440 --> 00:34:14,360
A walk is good.

674
00:34:14,760 --> 00:34:15,960
Out in the courtyard,

675
00:34:16,199 --> 00:34:17,840
there are lots of roses.

676
00:34:18,159 --> 00:34:20,559
The kind you girls like best.

677
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:21,639
Oh, right.

678
00:34:21,639 --> 00:34:22,840
Today is your birthday.

679
00:34:23,039 --> 00:34:24,880
I didn't have time to prepare anything.

680
00:34:25,159 --> 00:34:25,960
Come here.

681
00:34:38,280 --> 00:34:39,119
Mr. Cheng.

682
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:40,159
It's so late.

683
00:34:40,159 --> 00:34:41,480
Drinking all alone?

684
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:43,280
Get out.

685
00:34:43,679 --> 00:34:44,440
Mr. Cheng,

686
00:34:44,880 --> 00:34:46,079
Care to try my wine?

687
00:34:46,079 --> 00:34:47,320
I said, get out.

688
00:34:47,599 --> 00:34:50,000
I was just worried you'd be lonely.

689
00:34:50,159 --> 00:34:51,559
It's getting chilly tonight.

690
00:34:52,559 --> 00:34:53,800
You're wearing so little.

691
00:34:54,079 --> 00:34:55,320
Won't you catch a cold?
